# Packs whose skills still disagree with their front matter, or name something
# outside their dependency closure (tests/pack-links.test.sh, the bug checks).
# One pack id per line. A listed pack's findings are counted and do not fail;
# a pack listed with nothing left to find fails, so a pack's own change takes
# its line out. PACK_LINKS_VERBOSE=1 lists every finding of a listed pack, and
# PACK_LINKS_STRICT=1 ignores this file.
